   "text": "Joined CNBC's Squawk Box to talk about how 70% of AI revenues are coming from Anthropic and OpenAI, NVIDIA's vendor financing by proxy, and how outside of unprofitable AI labs, there's single-digit billions of dollars of demand for AI compute and software.\nyoutu.be/8GWPjTDPVIM",
   "handle": "edzitron.com",
   "display_name": "Ed Zitron",
   "likes": 693,
   "reposts": 129,
   "replies": 18,
   "created_at": "2026-08-12T12:54:19.817Z",
   "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/edzitron.com/post/3msv6ezeu4224",
   "image": "",
   "external": "https://youtu.be/8GWPjTDPVIM",
   "query": "Anthropic"
  },
  {
   "text": "If you’re tempted by the “AI summaries are just modern CliffsNotes” argument, please remember that CliffsNotes were written and edited by people who got paid to be accurate, not built on stolen data and extruded through a LLM that doesn’t know what truth is.",
   "handle": "fraying.bsky.social",
   "display_name": "Derek Powazek",
   "likes": 548,
   "reposts": 152,
   "replies": 6,
   "created_at": "2026-08-11T18:11:47.653Z",
   "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/fraying.bsky.social/post/3mst7nrdwh22l",
   "image": "",
   "external": "",
   "query": "LLM"
  },
  {
   "text": "A gentle reminder that Ellipsus will NEVER feed your writing to an LLM. We do not surveil your work and we will never introduce gen-AI into the tool.\n\nAI has no place in human writing.",
   "handle": "ellipsus.com",
   "display_name": "Ellipsus",
   "likes": 318,
   "reposts": 140,
   "replies": 0,
   "created_at": "2026-08-12T13:49:45.663Z",
   "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/ellipsus.com/post/3msvbi55ok22a",
   "image": "",
   "external": "",
   "query": "LLM"
  },
  {
   "text": "Despite myths that there's \"incredible demand for AI,\" 70%+ of hyperscaler AI revenues come from OpenAI and Anthropic. In FY26, $24.1bn of Microsoft's $34.33bn in AI revenue came from OpenAI - meaning that GPU rentals and AI software are single-digit billion dollar businesses.",
   "handle": "edzitron.com",
   "display_name": "Ed Zitron",
   "likes": 298,
   "reposts": 68,
   "replies": 11,
   "created_at": "2026-08-12T13:33:12.818Z",
   "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/edzitron.com/post/3msvakkcgek2z",
   "image": "",
   "external": "",
   "query": "OpenAI"
  },
  {
   "text": "I heard Southwest Airlines is refusing ICE. \n\nwww.thetravel.com/southwest-ai...",
   "handle": "writingisagift.bsky.social",
   "display_name": "Jill, MA Leguminati 🫘 ✍️",
   "likes": 221,
   "reposts": 46,
   "replies": 9,
   "created_at": "2026-08-11T19:02:44.867Z",
   "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/writingisagift.bsky.social/post/3mstciuwpxs2r",
   "image": "",
   "external": "https://www.thetravel.com/southwest-airlines-is-the-first-to-stand-up-to-ice-employee-blocks-agent-from-arresting-passenger/",
   "query": "AI agent"
  },
  {
   "text": "Dario Amodei of Anthropic claims to love American values, and I can think of nothing more American than competition. Yet his approach - masked as an \"AI arms race with China\" - is focused on crushing open source models that are competing with Claude at a lower price.",
   "handle": "edzitron.com",
   "display_name": "Ed Zitron",
   "likes": 235,
   "reposts": 36,
   "replies": 2,
   "created_at": "2026-08-12T13:07:17.235Z",
   "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/edzitron.com/post/3msv746rrek2z",
   "image": "",
   "external": "",
   "query": "Anthropic"
  },
  {
   "text": "Backlog is mostly OpenAI and Anthropic, CRWV yet to file 10-K but customer concentration has historically been 70% Microsoft + NVIDIA, costs increase linearly with expenses, revenues dependent on both customers and CRWV raising funds. The way this company is covered makes me feel insane",
   "handle": "edzitron.com",
   "display_name": "Ed Zitron",
   "likes": 230,
   "reposts": 22,
   "replies": 8,
   "created_at": "2026-08-11T20:49:17.206Z",
   "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/edzitron.com/post/3mstihf5fkc24",
   "image": "",
   "external": "",
   "query": "OpenAI"
  },
  {
   "text": "⚡ Sanctioned Nvidia AI tech was found inside Russia's new stealth missile. \n\nunited24media.com/defense-tech...",
   "handle": "united24media.com",
   "display_name": "UNITED24 Media",
   "likes": 131,
   "reposts": 64,
   "replies": 2,
   "created_at": "2026-08-12T08:46:24.462Z",
   "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/united24media.com/post/3msuqjrja5t2t",
   "image": "",
   "external": "https://united24media.com/defense-tech/russias-new-s-71m-stealth-missile-can-hunt-targets-with-ai-powered-by-nvidia-tech-it-shouldnt-have-21600",
   "query": "NVIDIA AI"
  },
  {
   "text": "UBS estimates that 48% of Google Cloud's 2027 revenues will come from Anthropic and OpenAI, who represent 70% of AI revenues across Amazon, Google and Microsoft. \nFor hyperscalers to meet analyst expectations, AI labs must raise hundreds of billions of dollars in the next three years.",
   "handle": "edzitron.com",
   "display_name": "Ed Zitron",
   "likes": 177,
   "reposts": 24,
   "replies": 1,
   "created_at": "2026-08-12T13:23:04.767Z",
   "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/edzitron.com/post/3msv7ygg5lk2z",
   "image": "",
   "external": "",
   "query": "Anthropic"
  },
  {
   "text": "The crucial part is that an exchange of value occurred. Circular financing still involves CoreWeave or whomever receiving and installing GPUs at some point, or like when Amazon invests in OpenAI and OpenAI pays it for compute, it’s still using compute\nbsky.app/profile/yeld...",
   "handle": "edzitron.com",
   "display_name": "Ed Zitron",
   "likes": 195,
   "reposts": 9,
