   "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/edzitron.com/post/3msuxznbtzc2b",
   "image": "",
   "external": "",
   "query": "OpenAI"
  },
  {
   "text": "I know I shouldn’t have, but I tested this on my school-provided Gemini account. You can definitely create a complete creationist curriculum with an LLM. If you don’t question the hypotheses, it won’t either. Indifferent to truth indeed.",
